add('b151','以早齡承載、基面黏結與厚度控制噴凝土支護~Control shotcrete support through early strength, substrate bond and installed thickness','噴層與岩塊、岩栓共同工作，空腔會改變受力路徑。~The layer interacts with rock blocks and bolts; cavities change its load path.','壓力由 0.10 增為 0.11 MPa，半徑和厚度不變，環力由 0.40 增為 0.44 MN/m，應力由 2.67 增為 2.93 MPa；這只適用完整環。~Increasing pressure from 0.10 to 0.11 MPa at fixed radius and thickness raises ring force from 0.40 to 0.44 MN/m and stress from 2.67 to 2.93 MPa, for an intact ring only.',r'''
薄殼受力與岩面接觸~Shell action and rock contact§黏結完整的噴層限制岩塊轉動，把局部作用傳給周圍岩體及岩栓。若岩面存在空腔，膜力路徑會局部轉成彎曲，平均壓應力合格仍可能有背面拉裂；完整圓環模型只用來辨認量級，不能代替節理岩塊的穩定分析。~A bonded layer restrains block rotation and transfers local actions to surrounding rock and bolts. Cavities convert membrane transfer into bending, allowing back-face tension despite acceptable mean compression. An intact-ring model establishes scale only and does not replace joint-block stability analysis.§N=pR=0.10 MPa*4 m=0.40 MN/m; sigma=N/t=0.40/0.15=2.67 MPa§將雷射斷面、敲擊空鼓圖與岩塊節理位置對齊比較~Compare laser sections and sounding maps registered to rock-block joints§未接觸區的集中彎曲造成裂紋，表面厚度正常仍可能剝落~Concentrated bending over noncontact zones cracks a layer of apparently normal thickness§平均厚度足夠便不必查岩面接觸~Adequate mean thickness removes the need to check rock contact
早齡強度與卸載時序~Early strength and unloading sequence§凝結只是材料開始形成骨架，不代表已達長期承載。開挖卸載與噴層硬化同時發生，下一循環擾動可能作用在仍弱的拱頂；室溫試件與潮濕寒冷岩面的成熟度不同，須用齡期和溫度描述同一強度狀態。~Setting starts formation of a material skeleton rather than providing long-term capacity. Excavation unloading competes with hardening, and the next disturbance can reach a weak crown. Laboratory and cold wet rock-face maturity differ, so age and temperature must describe a common strength state.§Inputs stress=0.60 MPa, earlyStrength=1.20 MPa; utilization=stress/earlyStrength=0.60/1.20=0.50; at earlyStrength=0.80 MPa it becomes 0.75§將早齡貫入或拔釘結果與原位溫度及噴射時間配對~Match early penetration or stud results to in-place temperature and spraying time§溫暖試件高估拱頂強度，使後續擾動造成不可逆微裂縫~Warm specimens overstate crown strength and subsequent disturbance creates irreversible microcracks§材料已經凝結就能承受全部設計荷載~A set material can already carry the full design load
回彈量與材料收支~Rebound and material balance§回彈物不是原配比的等比例縮小，骨材與纖維可能選擇性流失。泵送量只能描述供料，不能證明留在岩面的密度或纖維含量；材料帳應區分落地回彈、管路殘留與有效噴層，才可把厚度不足與輸送損失分開。~Rebound is not a scaled copy of the original mix because aggregate and fibres can be preferentially lost. Pumped volume does not prove installed density or fibre content. Separate rebound, line residue and retained layer so insufficient thickness can be distinguished from delivery losses.§Vretained=Vsupplied*(1-r)=12 m3*(1-0.18)=9.84 m3§以分區回彈收集重量及原位密度反算留存體積~Use zoned rebound mass and in-place density to reconstruct retained volume§回彈重新混入會引入污染並掩蓋纖維與骨材比例改變~Reintroduced rebound brings contamination and conceals changed fibre and aggregate proportions§泵送纖維含量就是岩面留存的纖維含量~Pump-feed fibre content equals fibre content retained on the rock
基面黏結與破壞界面~Bond and failure interfaces§粉塵、水膜與鬆動薄片會切斷噴層和基岩之間的剪力傳遞。拉拔量到的是試體中最弱路徑，可能位於膠層、噴凝土或岩石；相同峰值不代表相同修復方法，必須保留破壞面照片和各層位置才能判讀。~Dust, water films and loose flakes interrupt shear transfer to the substrate. A pull test samples the weakest path, which may lie in adhesive, shotcrete or rock. Equal peaks need not imply equal repairs; retain failure-face photographs and layer positions for interpretation.§bondStress=F/A=25 kN/0.025 m2=1.0 MPa§逐件記錄拉拔破壞面、濕度及切割邊界位置~Record the failure plane, moisture and isolation-cut boundary for every pull test§膠層剝離被錯當噴凝土失效，會導致錯誤的材料更換~Adhesive debonding misclassified as shotcrete failure leads to the wrong material replacement§拉拔數字相同就代表破壞原因完全相同~Equal pull-test values prove identical failure causes
鋼筋網背後的陰影區~Shadows behind reinforcement mesh§鋼筋網交叉點遮蔽噴流，外觀平順的表面可能蓋住相連蜂窩。網距、岩面凹凸與噴層厚度一起決定包覆難度；含網試板若沒有重現交叉節點，就只能驗材料，不能驗證現地幾何下的密實程度。~Mesh intersections shield the stream, and a smooth face can hide connected voids. Spacing, rock roughness and thickness jointly control encapsulation. A panel without representative intersections tests material but cannot verify consolidation within the installed geometry.§voidFraction=0.012 m3/0.30 m3=0.04=4 percent; solidVolume=0.288 m3§切開含相同網距的試板，統計交叉點背面的孔隙~Section panels with matching mesh spacing and quantify voids behind intersections§沿鋼筋連通的孔洞讓水快速進入並加速局部腐蝕~Connected voids along reinforcement admit water rapidly and accelerate local corrosion§表面平順便足以證明鋼筋網完全包覆~A smooth face proves complete encapsulation of reinforcement mesh
局部厚度與斷面配準~Local thickness and section registration§岩面起伏使同一材料體積產生不同的最薄厚度，局部彎曲與耐久往往由薄區主導。施工前後點雲必須共用控制基準，否則岩面突起會被誤讀為新增厚度；平均料量只能作總體收支，不能取代最薄處驗證。~Rock roughness gives different minimum thicknesses at equal material volume, while local bending and durability often depend on thin areas. Before-and-after clouds require common control; otherwise protrusions appear as added thickness. Delivered volume is a global balance rather than verification of local minima.§tavg=V/A=15 m3/100 m2=0.15 m; assumed local minimum=0.09 m§將厚度釘、鑽芯與雙期點雲在共同基準下互比~Compare thickness pins, cores and two-epoch clouds on a common datum§點雲錯位遮蔽薄區，造成局部剛度與保護層被高估~Cloud misregistration conceals thin zones and overstates local stiffness and cover§平均厚度合格便能忽略所有局部薄處~Passing mean thickness permits every local thin area to be ignored
芯樣方向與強度換算~Core orientation and strength interpretation§噴凝土有層間界面，取芯方向會改變荷載穿越界面的方式。端面不平又會引入偏心壓縮，兩種效應都能降低峰值但原因不同；試體形狀、齡期與飽水狀態必須一起記錄，不能把任意立方體結果直接套到拱頂。~Sprayed layers contain interfaces whose loading depends on coring direction. Uneven ends introduce eccentric compression; both effects reduce peaks for different reasons. Record geometry, age and saturation together rather than transferring an arbitrary cube result directly to the crown.§fc=F/A=200 kN/(pi*0.05^2 m2)=25.46 MPa§成組比較相同齡期但不同取芯方向的破壞形態~Compare failure shapes of same-age cores taken in different orientations§端面偏心造成假低強度，掩蓋真正的層間黏結問題~Eccentric end loading produces false low strength and obscures actual interlayer bond problems§不同尺寸與方向的試體強度都可以直接互換~Strengths from different specimen sizes and orientations are directly interchangeable
收斂與噴層應變零點~Convergence and strain-gauge zero§地層在噴層安裝前已變形，總收斂並不全部進入噴凝土。應變計晚歸零會刪除早期荷載，溫度又能造成非機械應變；需把噴射、安裝、歸零與後續開挖放在同一時間軸，才可比較環向收縮和材料應力。~Ground deforms before support installation, so total convergence does not all enter the lining. Late zeroing removes early load history, and temperature adds nonmechanical strain. Align spraying, installation, zeroing and excavation before comparing circumferential shortening with material stress.§epsilon=0.8 mm/4000 mm=0.0002; sigma=10 GPa*0.0002=2 MPa§把應變、溫度、收斂及儀器歸零時刻共同對時~Synchronize strain, temperature, convergence and gauge-zero timestamps§歸零後曲線平穩卻漏掉累積應力，錯判支護已卸載~A calm post-zero curve hides accumulated stress and falsely suggests unloading§量測儀器歸零就表示結構回到無應力~Zeroing a sensor returns the structure to a stress-free state
活動裂縫與耐久通路~Active cracks and durability paths§裂縫寬度描述某一時刻，無法單獨區分乾縮、溫度循環與岩體持續運動。水和侵蝕離子可沿裂縫優先進入，封閉表面可能把出水轉移到別處；維修判斷需追蹤同一裂縫的開合、水量及附近收斂歷史。~Width describes an instant rather than distinguishing shrinkage, thermal cycling and continued rock movement. Water and aggressive ions follow cracks, while sealing a face can redirect discharge. Repair decisions need the same crack's opening, flow and neighbouring convergence history.§openingRate=(0.30-0.18) mm/30 day=0.004 mm/day§以裂縫計、水量、溫度和固定視角照片追蹤同一位置~Track one location with crack gauges, flow, temperature and fixed-view photographs§活動裂縫被當成乾縮封補後重新開裂並改變漏水位置~An active crack treated as shrinkage reopens and shifts the leakage location§沒有漏水的裂縫一定不影響支護性能~A dry crack cannot affect the performance of tunnel support
分區品質與交接證據~Zoned quality and handover evidence§支護品質沿里程與環向都可能不同，將所有試件合併平均會失去對薄區和濕區的辨識。交接資料應連結地質、批次、噴射時刻和缺陷處置，讓後續裂紋能追溯到初期狀態，而不是只留下單一平均強度證明。~Quality varies along chainage and around the perimeter; pooling specimens conceals thin or wet zones. Link geology, batches, spraying times and defect disposition so later cracks can be traced to their initial condition rather than a single average-strength certificate.§coverage=verifiedZones/requiredZones=18/20=0.90=90 percent§逐區核對厚度、黏結、早齡強度及缺陷關閉紀錄~Audit thickness, bond, early strength and defect closure by zone§缺少里程對應的合格報告無法證明受損區曾受檢查~Unlocated passing reports cannot establish that a damaged zone was inspected§只要有一份合格報告就能代表整條隧道~One passing report represents the entire tunnel lining
''')

add('b152','以裂後荷載、能量積分與取樣方向驗證纖維噴凝土~Verify fibre shotcrete through postcrack load, energy integration and sampling direction','試板韌性屬特定幾何及邊界，不是整條隧道吸能容量。~Panel toughness belongs to a specific geometry and boundary, not whole-tunnel energy capacity.','平均力由 20 增為 22 kN、位移仍為 25 mm，能量由 500 增為 550 J；試板尺寸或支承變更時不能沿用這個比例。~At a fixed 25 mm travel, mean force rising from 20 to 22 kN increases energy from 500 to 550 J; changed panel geometry or support prevents direct transfer.',r'''
裂後承載與纖維橋接~Postcrack resistance and fibre bridging§首裂以前主要由水泥基材承受拉應力，裂後則由跨縫纖維傳力。纖維可能拔出、拉斷或與基材局部剝離，因此高抗壓不保證高殘餘荷載；應沿整條荷載位移曲線辨識峰值後的衰減，而非只比較最大力。~The matrix carries most tensile action before cracking; bridging fibres transfer force afterward. Pullout, rupture and local debonding create different responses, so high compression strength does not guarantee residual resistance. Inspect the complete postpeak curve rather than comparing maximum loads alone.§retention=Fres/Fpeak=18 kN/30 kN=0.60§在規定裂縫開口位置讀取殘餘力並標記首裂點~Read residual forces at specified crack openings and identify first cracking§高峰值後快速失載會被單一最大力報告掩蓋~Rapid postpeak loss is concealed by reporting only maximum force§抗壓強度高就代表纖維噴層韌性必然高~High compression strength guarantees high fibre-shotcrete toughness
力位移曲線的能量積分~Energy integration of force-displacement curves§試板吸收能量是荷載對測定位移的積分，單位為力乘距離。使用橫樑行程會混入機架與接觸變形，積分面積因而可能偏大；位移量測應明確指向試板中央或規定位置，並保存積分區間與離散方法。~Absorbed panel energy integrates force over the prescribed displacement. Crosshead travel includes machine and contact compliance and can inflate the area. Define displacement at the panel centre or specified location, and preserve the integration interval and discretization method.§E=Fmean*delta=20 kN*25 mm=500 J§以校正荷重及獨立中央位移重算梯形積分面積~Recompute trapezoidal area using calibrated force and independent central displacement§機架柔度被算成試板變形而高估材料吸能~Frame compliance counted as panel deformation overstates material energy absorption§荷載曲線下面積可以不管位移量測位置~Curve area is valid regardless of where displacement is measured
面板厚度與彎曲尺度~Panel thickness and bending scale§相同材料配比的面板，厚度改變會改變彎曲剛度、裂縫分布與纖維總數。梁條彎矩尺度對厚度平方敏感，但完整面板仍有雙向裂縫及膜效應；試驗比較必須先鎖定幾何，不可把厚板能量直接當成薄噴層的材料指標。~Thickness changes bending stiffness, crack distribution and the number of engaged fibres even at equal mix. A strip moment scale varies with thickness squared, while full panels add two-way cracking and membrane action. Fix geometry before treating energy as a material comparison.§M=f*b*h^2/6=3 MPa*0.10 m*(0.10 m)^2/6=0.50 kNm§量測試板各區厚度及支承位置，按相同幾何組別比較~Measure local panel thickness and support positions and compare matched geometries§厚試板掩蓋低纖維效果，現地薄區卻先裂損~A thick panel conceals weak fibre performance while thin installed zones crack first§不同厚度的試板能量可以直接比較優劣~Energy from panels of different thickness directly ranks material quality
纖維方向與法向力分量~Fibre orientation and normal force§纖維沿噴射方向及流動方向重新排列，跨越裂縫的角度影響法向傳力。餘弦可用來投影單根已知纖維的力，卻不能直接計算跨縫根數；根數還受位置、長度及三維取向分布控制，必須透過切面或影像取樣描述。~Spraying and flow orient fibres, and crossing angles affect normal transfer. A cosine projects a known fibre force but does not directly count crossings. Counts also depend on position, length and three-dimensional orientation, requiring section or image sampling rather than a force-projection shortcut.§Fnormal=100 N*cos(60 deg)=50 N; angle measured from crack normal§以切面纖維取向統計配對裂縫兩側的殘餘荷載~Pair sectional orientation statistics with residual loads across the crack§有利方向的試體高估另一方向現地裂縫的橋接力~Favourably oriented specimens overstate bridging across differently oriented field cracks§把纖維總根數乘餘弦就能得到跨縫根數~Multiplying total fibre count by a cosine gives the number crossing cracks
拔出功與界面滑移~Pullout work and interface slip§纖維拔出過程的摩擦與機械錨固能持續耗能，過強界面反而可能導致脆性拉斷。拔出功屬單根纖維與試件的組合，不能不考慮互相干擾便乘上所有纖維數；嵌入長度及端部形狀要隨試驗一起報告。~Friction and mechanical anchorage dissipate energy during pullout, whereas an overly strong interface can promote rupture. Single-fibre work belongs to that specimen system and cannot be multiplied by every fibre without interaction assumptions. Report embedment length and end shape with the result.§Wpull=Fmean*slip=80 N*0.010 m=0.80 J per assumed fibre§記錄拔出曲線、嵌入長度及斷纖或滑移的比例~Record pullout curves, embedment lengths and proportions of rupture versus sliding§表面鍍層變化使滑移功降低，即使鋼絲強度不變~A changed surface coating reduces sliding work despite unchanged wire strength§鋼絲抗拉強度相同就保證拔出能量相同~Equal wire tensile strength guarantees identical pullout energy
取樣批次與纖維分散~Sampling batches and fibre dispersion§材料平均纖維質量相同，局部團聚仍會造成弱區。小試樣若只來自易取位置，容易漏掉噴射陰影或回彈較大的區段；抽樣應保留空間位置，將分散度和平均值分開呈現，才能辨識材料混合與施工方向的影響。~Equal mean fibre mass can coexist with local clusters and weak zones. Convenient small samples can miss spray shadows or high-rebound areas. Retain spatial locations and report dispersion separately from the mean to distinguish mixing effects from placement orientation.§CV=standardDeviation/mean=5 kg/m3/35 kg/m3=0.143=14.3 percent§以分區洗出或適當材料辨識法比較纖維量離散~Compare spatial fibre-content dispersion using washout or suitable material identification§團聚區與缺纖區互相平均，留下低韌性的薄弱帶~Clusters average with fibre-poor zones and leave a low-toughness band§平均纖維用量符合就不需要檢查分散均勻度~Passing mean fibre dosage removes the need to assess dispersion
荷重位移同步與零點~Force-displacement synchronization and zero§能量積分需要同一時刻的荷重與位移，資料流延遲會把峰值配到錯誤開口。試件接觸前的行程不應列入試板變形，接觸壓密又須與真正裂後位移區分；儀器零點、取樣率及濾波設定都會影響曲線形狀。~Energy integration requires synchronized force and displacement; stream delay pairs a peak with the wrong opening. Precontact motion is not panel deflection, and seating differs from postcrack displacement. Zero, sampling rate and filters therefore influence the interpreted curve.§phaseTravel=loadingSpeed*timeLag=0.5 mm/min*0.2 min=0.10 mm§用共同事件校核兩通道時間差及接觸零點~Check channel lag and contact zero with a shared identifiable event§時間錯位扭曲裂後面積，造成虛假的韌性增益~Timing mismatch distorts postcrack area and creates false toughness improvement§荷重與位移各自準確就不需要同步取樣~Accurate force and displacement channels do not need synchronized sampling
重複試驗與不確定度~Repeated tests and uncertainty§纖維跨縫數具隨機性，單一試板不能代表整批材料。增加重複數能改善平均值估計，但不能補救有偏的取樣位置；報告應區分樣本標準差與平均值標準誤，並展示個別曲線以辨認異常破壞型態。~Random fibre crossings make one panel insufficient for a batch. Replication improves estimation of the mean but cannot correct biased sampling positions. Separate sample standard deviation from standard error and show individual curves so unusual failure patterns remain visible.§standardError=s/sqrt(n)=60 J/sqrt(9)=20 J§比較九片獨立試板的個別曲線、平均值與離散~Compare individual curves, mean and dispersion from nine independent panels§只報平均值掩蓋少數極低能量試件及取樣偏差~A mean-only report hides very low-energy specimens and sampling bias§重複次數多就能自動消除所有系統誤差~Many repetitions automatically eliminate every systematic error
環境老化與殘餘能力~Environmental ageing and residual resistance§裂縫開放後纖維及界面暴露於水與化學環境，長期表現不能只由初期能量推定。加速試驗的溫度或溶液可能改變失效機制，因此老化前後必須採同幾何及同位移定義，並檢查裂縫處的實際腐蝕或脆化證據。~Open cracks expose fibres and interfaces to water and chemistry, so initial energy cannot establish long-term resistance. Accelerated temperature or solution may change the failure mechanism. Compare identical geometry and displacement definitions and inspect actual corrosion or embrittlement at cracks.§retainedEnergy=420 J/500 J=0.84=84 percent§對照老化前後同幾何試板及裂面纖維外觀~Compare matching panels before and after ageing and inspect fibres on fracture faces§不相容的加速環境產生錯誤外推，低估現地界面劣化~An unrepresentative accelerated exposure mispredicts field interface degradation§初期韌性合格就保證整個設計年限不衰退~Passing initial toughness guarantees no deterioration throughout the design life
性能規格與試法交接~Performance specifications and method handover§規格若只寫一個焦耳數卻沒有試板尺寸、支承及截止位移，數字缺乏可比較的物理意義。梁試驗和板試驗有不同裂縫路徑，不能直接換算；交接應保留版本、曲線和取樣方向，讓維修材料採用同一性能語言。~A joule requirement without panel size, supports and terminal displacement lacks a comparable physical meaning. Beams and panels form different crack paths and are not directly interchangeable. Preserve method editions, curves and sampling directions so repair materials use the same performance definition.§methodCompleteness=recordedRequiredFields/requiredFields=7/8=87.5 percent§逐項核對試法版本、支承、厚度、取向與截止位移~Audit method edition, support, thickness, orientation and terminal displacement§不同試法結果被拼成一張合格表而無法重算~Different test methods are pooled into a passing table that cannot be reproduced§只要報告單位都是焦耳就能跨試法直接比較~Results expressed in joules can always be compared across test methods
''')
add('b153','辨識岩栓鋼材、漿體與岩體界面的拉拔傳力~Distinguish bolt steel, grout and rock interfaces in pullout load transfer','單支拉拔只檢驗局部系統，不能直接證明整個岩楔穩定。~A single pull test examines a local system and does not establish whole-wedge stability.','假想岩楔由 4 增為 5 m3，單位重 26 kN/m3 不變，重量由 104 增為 130 kN；兩支垂直岩栓只有在理想對稱下才各分擔 65 kN。~Increasing assumed wedge volume from 4 to 5 m3 at 26 kN/m3 raises weight from 104 to 130 kN; two vertical bolts share 65 kN each only under ideal symmetry.',r'''
岩楔荷重與岩栓方向~Wedge weight and bolt direction§岩栓能否穩住岩楔取決於節理幾何、摩擦以及力的方向，而非單看根數。垂直分量必須平衡重力，水平分量可能改變節理正向力；將所有岩栓當成平均分擔會忽略偏心與先後受力，需先畫出可移動岩塊的自由體圖。~Wedge restraint depends on joint geometry, friction and bolt orientation rather than count alone. Vertical components balance gravity while horizontal components can modify joint normal force. Equal sharing ignores eccentricity and sequential engagement, so first isolate the movable block in a free-body diagram.§W=gamma*V=26 kN/m3*4 m3=104 kN; two symmetric vertical bolts carry 52 kN each§將節理交線、岩楔體積與岩栓方向畫在同一量測圖~Plot joint intersections, wedge volume and bolt directions in the same surveyed geometry§岩栓未穿越滑動面，試驗合格仍可能隨岩楔一起掉落~A bolt not crossing the sliding surface can pass a pull test yet fall with the wedge§岩栓數量足夠便不必考慮節理方向~Enough bolts remove the need to consider joint orientation
鋼材屈服與有效面積~Steel yielding and effective area§鋼材承載面積可能由螺紋根部或腐蝕局部截面控制，不一定等於公稱直徑。拉拔系統也包含接頭和夾具，若先發生局部滑移，量得曲線便不是純鋼材拉伸；應把鋼材屈服與界面拔出分開設定模型。~The thread root or a locally corroded section may control steel area rather than nominal diameter. Connections and grips also belong to the pull system; early slip produces a response unlike pure steel tension. Model steel yielding separately from interface pullout and identify which limit is being tested.§Ny=A*fy=314 mm2*500 N/mm2=157000 N=157 kN§核對螺紋有效面積、材證與載入後的永久伸長~Check thread area, material certificates and permanent elongation after loading§以光桿面積計算高估螺紋承載，破壞集中在接頭~Using shank area overstates thread capacity and concentrates failure at the connection§岩栓公稱直徑足以代表所有承載截面~Nominal bolt diameter represents every load-carrying section
漿體黏結與有效長度~Grout bond and effective length§沿錨固段的剪應力通常不均勻，受拉端先動員而遠端可能尚未充分參與。均勻黏結公式只能作平均量級，裂隙、灌漿空洞與孔壁擾動會減少有效長度；提高漿體抗壓也不一定改善岩漿界面的剪力傳遞。~Bond shear is nonuniform: the loaded end mobilizes before distant sections. A uniform-bond formula provides an average scale only. Fractures, grout voids and disturbed bore walls reduce effective length, while greater grout compression strength need not improve rock-grout shear transfer.§N=pi*d*L*tau=pi*0.05 m*2 m*0.30 MPa=94.25 kN§以拉拔曲線配對灌漿量、孔徑和可用孔內影像~Pair pull curves with grout volume, bore diameter and available borehole images§漿體空洞縮短有效長度，使局部剪應力提早達峰~Grout voids shorten effective length and bring local shear to its peak early§灌漿總量足夠就證明整段錨固完全密實~Adequate total grout volume proves complete consolidation along the anchorage
托盤承壓與岩面凹凸~Plate bearing and rock roughness§托盤把軸力傳給局部岩面，實際接觸面積受凹凸、薄片和墊層影響。整片鋼板面積不等於受壓面積，局部壓碎可使預力流失而鋼栓仍完好；托盤轉角與岩面裂紋因此是傳力判讀的重要證據。~A plate transfers axial force to local rock contact controlled by roughness, flakes and bedding. Gross plate area is not necessarily bearing area. Local crushing can lose preload while the bolt remains intact, making plate rotation and surrounding cracks important transfer evidence.§bearingStress=80 kN/0.020 m2=4 MPa; half the contact area gives 8 MPa§觀察托盤接觸印跡、轉角及周圍岩面裂紋~Inspect plate contact marks, rotation and cracks in the surrounding rock§托盤下薄片壓碎造成滑移，誤被判成鋼栓延伸~Crushed flakes beneath the plate cause slip mistaken for bolt elongation§鋼托盤沒有變形就代表岩面承壓正常~An undeformed steel plate proves acceptable rock bearing
自由段伸長與系統柔度~Free-length extension and system compliance§量到的位移包含自由鋼材伸長、錨固滑移、夾具變形與反力架沉陷。用全長代入純鋼伸長公式會錯把黏結段當成自由段；比較載卸曲線可辨認可回復彈性與不可回復滑移，但仍需要獨立基準才能分離支承移動。~Measured movement combines free steel extension, bond slip, grip deformation and reaction-frame settlement. Full-length elastic calculation wrongly treats bonded length as free. Loading-unloading response distinguishes recoverable extension from slip, but independent references are still needed to separate support movement.§delta=N*L/(E*A)=100000 N*2000 mm/(200000 N/mm2*314 mm2)=3.18 mm§用獨立位移計量測栓頭、夾具及反力架的相對移動~Measure relative motion of bolt head, grip and reaction frame with independent gauges§反力架沉陷被計入岩栓位移，造成假性低剛度~Reaction-frame settlement counted as bolt movement produces false low stiffness§千斤頂行程就等於岩栓本身的伸長~Jack travel always equals elongation of the bolt itself
反力位置與局部約束~Reaction location and local restraint§拉拔反力若直接壓在受測錨固區附近，會提高局部圍壓並改變岩體破壞路徑。測試看似只是向外拉，實際同時向內壓縮周邊岩面；反力支點尺寸與間距必須記錄，才可知道結果代表何種約束條件。~Reaction close to the anchorage increases confinement and alters rock failure paths. Pulling outward simultaneously compresses nearby ground inward. Record reaction footprint and spacing so the result can be interpreted under its actual restraint rather than as an unconstrained rock capacity.§reactionPressure=100 kN/0.10 m2=1000 kPa=1 MPa§記錄反力腳位置及岩面變形，對照預期破壞區~Record reaction feet and rock-surface movement relative to the predicted failure zone§過近反力壓住潛在破壞錐，使拉拔能力被高估~Nearby reaction suppresses a potential breakout cone and overstates pull resistance§反力架只影響設備而不會改變岩體行為~The reaction frame affects equipment but never the surrounding rock
持載位移與時間效應~Hold movement and time effects§恆定荷重下位移增加可能來自黏結蠕變，也可能是油壓漂移或支承沉陷。必須同時記錄實際荷重，才能區分持載滑移與荷重仍在增加；單一時間點的位移不能代表速率，更不能直接外推長期壽命。~Movement under constant load can reflect bond creep, pressure drift or support settlement. Record actual force simultaneously to distinguish hold slip from continued loading. One displacement point establishes neither a rate nor a reliable extrapolation of long-term service behaviour.§movementRate=(2.4-1.8) mm/10 min=0.06 mm/min§同步保存持載期間荷重、位移、溫度及支承基準~Synchronize force, displacement, temperature and support references during the hold§油壓緩升被錯判為黏結蠕變，引出不必要的補強~A slow pressure increase mistaken for bond creep prompts unnecessary reinforcement§持載位移增加一定只代表岩漿界面蠕變~Increasing hold displacement always means rock-grout interface creep alone
荷重校正與不確定度~Load calibration and uncertainty§壓力乘活塞面積只是理想液壓力，密封摩擦、有效面積與回程方向會造成偏差。荷重元可提供獨立比較，但也需校正與對中；不確定度應和試體離散分開報告，避免把設備偏差歸因於地質變化。~Pressure times piston area gives ideal hydraulic force; seal friction, effective area and direction introduce bias. A load cell offers independent comparison but also needs calibration and alignment. Separate instrumental uncertainty from specimen variability instead of attributing equipment bias to geology.§Fideal=20 MPa*0.005 m2=100 kN; measured=96 kN; difference=4 percent§用可追溯荷重元比較不同荷重階段及載卸方向~Compare traceable load-cell readings across force levels and loading directions§忽略密封摩擦使低荷重讀值偏差，扭曲初始剛度~Ignored seal friction biases low-load readings and distorts initial stiffness§油壓表精確就能保證實際拉力完全精確~An accurate pressure gauge guarantees completely accurate applied tensile force
腐蝕損失與局部弱截面~Corrosion loss and local weak sections§腐蝕不一定沿全長均勻，孔口水氣和裂縫可能造成局部截面損失。直徑減少對面積有平方影響，局部坑蝕又會加劇應力集中；用平均重量損失推估剩餘承載，需要確認最小截面及腐蝕分布是否已被量到。~Corrosion can concentrate near wet collars and fractures rather than being uniform. Diameter loss changes area quadratically, and pits add stress concentration. Inferring capacity from mean mass loss requires evidence that the minimum section and corrosion distribution have actually been characterized.§remainingAreaRatio=(18 mm/20 mm)^2=0.81=81 percent§檢查孔口防護、水質及可見最小直徑並追蹤時間變化~Inspect collar protection, water chemistry and visible minimum diameter over time§局部坑蝕被平均失重掩蓋，岩栓在弱截面突然斷裂~Local pitting hidden by mean mass loss causes rupture at the weakest section§平均腐蝕量很小就保證每一截面承載正常~Small average corrosion guarantees adequate resistance at every section
試驗代表性與補強決策~Representativeness and reinforcement decisions§拉拔試點通常只覆蓋少量岩栓，結果的適用範圍由地質、施工批次及錨固型式決定。可接近位置可能比濕區或破碎區容易施工，取樣偏差會留下未驗證族群；交接須讓每個結果能追溯到同類岩栓，而不是以全區平均替代分區判讀。~Pull tests sample few bolts, with applicability governed by geology, batches and anchorage type. Accessible positions may be easier to install than wet or fractured areas, leaving unverified populations. Trace each result to comparable bolts instead of substituting a global mean for zoned interpretation.§samplingCoverage=testedZones/definedZones=8/10=80 percent§依地質、批次及錨固型式建立試驗分層對照表~Stratify test records by geology, batch and anchorage type§僅測易施工區造成選樣偏差，危險區卻沒有代表資料~Testing only easy zones biases the sample and leaves critical zones unrepresented§抽測平均合格就可以證明所有地區的岩栓安全~A passing sample mean proves bolt safety in every geological zone
''')

add('b154','把鋼拱、格柵、噴凝土與基腳組成可驗證支護系統~Combine steel ribs, lattices, shotcrete and feet into a verifiable support system','單榀承載取決於接頭、側向連繫及地層接觸，不只鋼材強度。~A rib depends on joints, lateral bracing and ground contact as well as steel strength.','間距由 0.75 增為 1.0 m，在壓力 0.08 MPa、半徑 4 m 的理想環模型下，單榀環力由 240 增為 320 kN；噴層跨距效應另算。~Increasing spacing from 0.75 to 1.0 m at pressure 0.08 MPa and radius 4 m raises ideal rib thrust from 240 to 320 kN; shotcrete span effects require separate assessment.',r'''
榀距與分擔寬度~Rib spacing and tributary width§相鄰鋼拱間距決定單榀承受的地層分擔寬度，間距增加同時拉大噴層縱向跨距。完整圓環均壓可估環向軸力，但局部鬆動塊會引入彎矩；應分開平均地層壓力與集中作用，不能只以環力判斷全部構件。~Spacing determines each rib's tributary ground width and the longitudinal span of shotcrete. Uniform pressure on an intact ring estimates hoop thrust, but loose blocks introduce bending. Separate average ground pressure from concentrated actions rather than treating ring thrust as the complete member demand.§N=p*R*s=0.08 MPa*4 m*0.75 m=240 kN§沿里程量測實際榀距並對照地質鬆動區與噴層厚度~Compare measured rib spacing with loosened ground zones and shotcrete thickness§局部超間距加大構件力與噴層彎曲，平均間距卻正常~A locally wide bay increases rib force and shotcrete bending despite a normal mean spacing§只要平均榀距符合就不必檢查局部跨距~Passing average rib spacing removes the need to check local spans
軸力偏心與彎矩~Axial eccentricity and bending§鋼拱與岩面接觸不均會使壓力偏離截面中心，名義壓縮構件因而同時彎曲。接頭與基腳的旋轉也會移動作用線，不能用截面積增加掩蓋偏心；應先辨識接觸點及變形後幾何，再決定是否需二階分析。~Uneven ground contact moves force away from the section centre and bends a nominal compression member. Joint and foot rotation also move the load line. Increasing area does not resolve eccentricity; identify contact locations and deformed geometry before deciding on second-order analysis.§M=N*e=240 kN*0.05 m=12 kNm§對照鋼拱斷面掃描、接觸點及內外緣應變差~Compare rib geometry, contact points and differences between inner and outer strains§只看平均壓應變漏掉單側拉應力與局部屈曲~Mean compression alone conceals one-sided tension and local buckling§拱架承受壓力就不會同時產生彎矩~A rib carrying compression cannot simultaneously develop bending moments
鋼拱弱軸與有效長度~Weak-axis buckling and effective length§拱面內有支承不代表拱面外也被約束，縱向連繫的位置決定弱軸有效長度。Euler 公式只適用理想彈性直柱，彎曲拱架還有初始缺陷和非均勻受力；它適合揭示連繫缺失的敏感度，不應當成實際承載保證。~In-plane restraint does not establish out-of-plane restraint; longitudinal ties control weak-axis effective length. Euler's ideal straight-column model omits curved geometry, imperfections and nonuniform force. It reveals sensitivity to missing ties rather than guaranteeing actual rib resistance.§Pcr=pi^2*E*I/L^2=pi^2*200 GPa*2e-6 m4/(2 m)^2=987 kN§查核連繫間距、接頭固定度及拱面外偏移量~Check tie spacing, connection restraint and out-of-plane offsets§缺少一段連繫讓有效長度倍增，理想屈曲力降至四分之一~One missing tie bay doubles effective length and quarters ideal buckling force§有噴凝土包覆就能假定所有方向完全側撐~Shotcrete cover permits complete lateral restraint to be assumed in every direction
格柵桁架與節點~Lattice trusses and nodes§格柵以主筋和腹桿形成小型桁架，節點把剪力傳到弦材。若腹桿焊接缺陷或幾何偏差存在，名義鋼量相同仍有不同剛度；噴凝土填滿格柵後才可能建立預期複合作用，不能忽略空隙與施工前裸架狀態。~A lattice transfers shear through webs into chord bars. Weld defects or geometric deviations change stiffness despite equal steel mass. Intended composite action requires shotcrete to fill the lattice, while voids and the exposed pre-encapsulation stage remain distinct structural states.§chordForce=M/h=9 kNm/0.30 m=30 kN in an ideal chord pair§核對格柵高度、腹桿節點及包覆後的填充完整性~Check lattice depth, web nodes and filling completeness after encapsulation§節點脫開使局部主筋單獨彎曲，桁架假設失效~A detached node leaves a chord bending locally and invalidates the truss assumption§主筋總面積相同就代表所有格柵剛度相同~Equal total chord area means identical stiffness for every lattice geometry
接頭滑移與力線連續~Joint slip and force continuity§分段鋼拱的接頭必須傳遞設計所需軸力與彎矩，接觸間隙可能讓兩側先後受力。螺栓鎖緊不是連續剛接的證明，滑移後作用線還會偏移；應把接頭剛度與允許變形列入整榀模型，而非把接頭當成無長度連線。~Segment joints must transfer the required thrust and moment, but gaps engage the two sides at different times. Tight bolts do not prove rigid continuity, and slip moves the load line. Include joint stiffness and deformation in the rib model rather than an ideal zero-length connection.§jointStiffness=deltaF/deltaSlip=100 kN/2 mm=50 kN/mm§量測接縫開口與滑移，對照載入時兩側應變~Measure joint opening and slip alongside strains on both sides§接縫滑移集中變形，造成背後噴層開裂與漏水通路~Joint slip concentrates deformation and opens cracks and leakage paths behind the rib§螺栓已鎖緊就能把接頭視為完全剛接~Tightened bolts make every rib joint perfectly rigid
基腳承載與沉陷~Foot bearing and settlement§鋼拱荷載最後由基腳傳入地層，鬆軟或受水擾動的基底可能先於鋼材屈服。基腳沉陷會使拱形變扁並增加彎曲，單側沉陷尤其不利；擴大底板也需確認真正接觸面積，不能把懸空板面列入承壓。~Footings transfer rib actions into ground that may soften or erode before steel yields. Settlement flattens the arch and increases bending, especially if asymmetric. Larger plates help only where contact exists; unsupported plate area cannot be counted as bearing area.§q=N/A=240 kN/0.40 m2=600 kPa§以基腳水準、接觸印跡及地層含水狀態同步追蹤~Track foot levels, contact marks and ground moisture together§單側基腳下陷使拱頂偏移，構件強度合格仍失穩~One sinking foot displaces the crown and destabilizes otherwise adequate members§鋼材強度合格就不需要驗算拱架基腳~Adequate steel strength removes the need to assess rib feet
複合噴層與變形相容~Composite shotcrete and compatibility§鋼拱與噴凝土只有在接觸及剪力傳遞足夠時才能共同分擔荷載。材料模數與齡期不同，先受力的鋼拱不會因後續噴層硬化而自動卸載；組合剛度只是同時變形下的理想上限，須保留實際施工載入歷史。~Steel and shotcrete share loads only with sufficient contact and shear transfer. Their moduli and ages differ, and steel loaded earlier does not automatically unload as shotcrete hardens. Combined stiffness is an ideal compatibility model requiring the actual staged loading history.§EAsteel=200 GPa*0.003 m2=600 MN; EAshotcrete=10 GPa*0.10 m2=1000 MN§對時比較鋼材和噴層應變及各自開始受力時刻~Compare steel and shotcrete strains with their respective loading-start times§把全部荷載按完工剛度重分配會低估鋼拱既有應力~Redistributing all load by final stiffness understates stress already carried by steel§噴層硬化後鋼拱原本的應力會自動消失~Steel stress automatically disappears when the surrounding shotcrete hardens
輪廓測量與二階效應~Profile survey and second-order response§拱架初始偏位與後續收斂會改變軸力作用線，附加彎矩與軸力及偏移成正比。位移小不代表可忽略，因為壓力可能很大；量測應分開安裝誤差與荷載造成的變形，否則模型初始幾何與監測零點彼此矛盾。~Initial offsets and convergence move the thrust line, creating an added moment proportional to force and displacement. Small motion may matter under large compression. Separate installation error from load-induced deformation so model geometry and monitoring zero do not contradict one another.§Msecond=P*delta=300 kN*0.020 m=6 kNm§用安裝後基準斷面比較各時期冠頂與側壁偏移~Compare crown and wall offsets against the as-installed reference section§重設量測零點掩蓋累積偏位，低估二階彎矩~Resetting the survey zero hides accumulated offset and understates second-order moment§位移只有幾毫米就可以永遠忽略二階效應~A few millimetres of movement always makes second-order effects negligible
腐蝕與未包覆區~Corrosion and uncovered zones§拱架接頭、基腳及噴層空洞是容易接觸水氣的位置，腐蝕往往不是沿整榀均勻分布。厚度減少會同時影響面積與局部板件穩定，不能只用外表鏽色分級；檢查位置應與漏水和原施工空鼓紀錄互相連結。~Joints, feet and shotcrete voids expose ribs to moisture, producing localized rather than uniform corrosion. Thickness loss affects both area and local plate stability; rust colour alone is insufficient. Relate inspection positions to leakage and original void records.§thicknessLoss=(8-6) mm/8 mm=25 percent§在接頭及濕區量測剩餘厚度，配對空鼓與漏水圖~Measure remaining thickness at joints and wet zones against void and leakage maps§隱藏空洞持續進水造成局部減薄，外露乾區卻正常~Wet hidden cavities thin local steel while exposed dry areas appear sound§外露鋼材看起來良好就能代表包覆區無腐蝕~Sound exposed steel proves corrosion is absent in covered areas
隱蔽工程與交接追溯~Concealed works and handover traceability§噴層完成後接頭、連繫及基腳難以直接觀察，施工前照片和幾何紀錄具有不可替代性。單一材料證書只能說明鋼材供應，不能證明現地連接；交接須把每榀編號連到檢查結果和修補版本，讓後續異常能定位到特定構造。~Encapsulation hides joints, ties and feet, making pre-cover photographs and geometry irreplaceable. A mill certificate describes supplied steel rather than installed connections. Link every rib identifier to inspections and repair revisions so later anomalies can be traced to the actual detail.§traceability=fullyLinkedRibs/installedRibs=46/50=92 percent§按榀號核對接頭、連繫、基腳與包覆前照片~Audit joints, ties, feet and pre-cover photographs by rib identifier§無法定位的施工照片使缺失區域無從追查與維修~Unlocated construction photographs prevent tracing and repairing a defective zone§材料證書齊全就等於現地鋼拱系統已驗證~Complete material certificates prove the installed rib system has been verified
''')

add('b155','用縱向跨距、搭接與鑽孔幾何檢核管棚超前支護~Check pipe umbrellas through longitudinal spans, overlap and bore geometry','管棚依賴前方地層及後方初支共同反力，並非獨立懸空屋頂。~The umbrella relies on reactions from ground ahead and support behind; it is not a free-standing roof.','理想簡支跨度由 3.0 增為 3.3 m，均布線荷載 30 kN/m 不變，彎矩由 33.75 增為 40.84 kNm，增加 21%；連續地層支承仍須另建模。~At fixed 30 kN/m, increasing an ideal simple span from 3.0 to 3.3 m raises moment from 33.75 to 40.84 kNm, by 21%; continuous ground restraint requires a separate model.',r'''
縱向橋接與反力路徑~Longitudinal bridging and reactions§管棚把開挖前方部分荷載跨越未支護區傳給後方初支和前方地層。反力不是固定鉸支點，會隨地層鬆動及支護沉陷移動；簡支梁可用來理解跨距平方的敏感度，但不能隱去土管接觸和開挖循環的影響。~An umbrella bridges an unsupported zone and transfers load to previous support and ground ahead. Reactions move as ground loosens and support settles rather than acting as fixed hinges. A simple beam reveals squared-span sensitivity but does not capture contact changes and excavation cycles.§M=q*L^2/8=30 kN/m*(3 m)^2/8=33.75 kNm§把管棚撓度、初支沉陷及掌子面距離共同對時~Synchronize umbrella deflection, initial-support settlement and face distance§後方初支下沉擴大有效跨距，管材強度未變卻彎曲增加~Rear support settlement lengthens the effective span and increases bending without changing pipe strength§管棚只要夠長就不需要後方支護反力~A sufficiently long umbrella does not require reactions from rear support
鋼管截面與抗彎剛度~Pipe section and flexural stiffness§鋼管抗彎剛度對直徑分布敏感，增加鋼材重量不一定等比例增加截面慣性矩。接頭處有效截面與母材不同，腐蝕或磨耗也可能降低壁厚；計算必須明確區分外徑、內徑及接頭剛度，不能只填一個公稱口徑。~Pipe stiffness depends on how material is distributed about the axis, not weight alone. Connections differ from the parent section, while corrosion and wear can reduce wall thickness. Distinguish outside diameter, inside diameter and joint stiffness instead of using a single nominal size.§Inputs D,d in m; I=pi*(D^4-d^4)/64=pi*(0.114^4-0.102^4)/64=2.98e-6 m4§核對管材外內徑及接頭位置，抽測實際壁厚~Check outside and inside diameters, connection locations and measured wall thickness§將公稱直徑當外徑會錯算慣性矩和彎曲應力~Treating nominal size as outside diameter miscalculates inertia and bending stress§鋼管每米重量相同就代表抗彎剛度相同~Equal steel-pipe mass per metre guarantees equal bending stiffness
開孔間距與拱頂連續性~Pipe spacing and crown continuity§管棚是離散管件，管間土體需要自身拱效應或其他改良才能把荷載傳到管上。間距以孔口量到不代表遠端仍相同，鑽孔發散會產生局部大空隙；評估應檢查最不利遠端幾何而非只看環向平均間距。~An umbrella consists of discrete pipes; intervening ground needs arching or treatment to deliver load to them. Collar spacing does not establish distal spacing because divergent holes create gaps. Inspect the least favourable distant geometry rather than only the mean circumferential pitch.§gap=centreSpacing-outsideDiameter=0.35 m-0.114 m=0.236 m§重建孔口及遠端位置，沿長度比較相鄰管件淨距~Reconstruct collar and distal positions and compare pipe clear gaps along their length§孔口排列整齊但遠端發散，局部土體從管間鬆落~Orderly collars conceal distal divergence and local ground falls between pipes§孔口間距合格便能證明整段管棚連續~Passing collar spacing proves continuity throughout the umbrella length
搭接長度與施工循環~Overlap and excavation cycles§相鄰兩輪管棚的搭接維持縱向傳力，但有效搭接還受鑽孔偏差、端部品質和前一輪變形影響。總長減進尺只是名義值，不能保證搭接區同時具備地層反力；各循環應把初支位置與下一輪孔口連在同一里程帳。~Overlap maintains transfer between successive umbrellas, but effective overlap depends on deviation, end quality and previous deformation. Length minus advance is nominal geometry rather than proof of ground reaction. Link support position and the next collar in a common chainage record for every cycle.§nominalOverlap=pipeLength-cycleAdvance=12 m-9 m=3 m§將各輪實際進尺、孔長及初支末端位置逐段核對~Audit actual advances, pipe lengths and last support positions by cycle§累積超進尺吃掉搭接，造成兩輪之間的局部弱帶~Accumulated excess advance consumes overlap and leaves a weak band between umbrellas§只要每支管長正確就能保證所有搭接足夠~Correct individual pipe lengths guarantee adequate overlap in every cycle
鑽孔傾角與端部偏位~Bore inclination and end offset§微小角度偏差在長孔末端會形成顯著位移，角度與坡度百分比混用更會造成系統錯誤。管棚需要符合空間扇形幾何而非只控制單一平面，端部高低和左右偏差都會改變拱頂覆蓋及與下一輪的交接。~Small angular errors create substantial distal offsets, while confusing angle with percent grade creates systematic bias. An umbrella is a three-dimensional fan rather than a single-plane alignment. Both vertical and lateral offsets alter crown coverage and the next overlap interface.§endOffset=L*tan(error)=12 m*tan(1 deg)=0.209 m§以孔內測斜或核准導向資料重建三維孔軸~Reconstruct three-dimensional bore axes from inclinometry or approved guidance records§同方向小偏差累積，使遠端管棚整體偏離需要支護區~Small consistent errors move the entire distal umbrella outside the support zone§一度角度誤差在長管棚中永遠可以忽略~A one-degree error can always be ignored in a long umbrella
環狀灌漿體積與空隙~Annular grout volume and voids§孔壁和鋼管間的環隙需要足夠接觸傳力，注入量卻可能流入裂隙而非填滿環空。幾何體積只能作收支基線，土體擾動、孔徑擴大及漏失都會改變實際需要；過量和不足都應先辨認來源，不能直接當作品質好壞。~The annulus must transfer contact forces, yet delivered grout may enter fractures instead of filling it. Geometric volume is a baseline altered by disturbance, enlargement and loss. Diagnose both excess and shortage rather than interpreting either directly as good or poor quality.§Inputs boreDiameter=0.17 m, pipeDiameter=0.114 m, length=12 m; Vann=pi*(0.17^2-0.114^2)/4*12=0.150 m3§比較幾何環空、實際注入量及可用回流或影像證據~Compare geometric annulus, delivered volume and available return or imaging evidence§漿液流向裂隙但管周仍空，名義注量合格卻缺乏接觸~Grout escapes into fractures while a hollow annulus remains despite adequate nominal volume§實際注量越大就一定代表管周填充越完整~Greater delivered grout volume always means more complete annular filling
地層彈簧與支承剛度~Ground springs and restraint stiffness§土管接觸可用分布彈簧作初步理想化，但土體只能在接觸時提供壓縮反力。若模型容許土體承拉，會在人為懸空區產生不存在的支承；彈簧係數還須配合單位長度或面積定義，否則量綱正確的數字也會套錯位置。~Distributed springs can approximate soil-pipe contact, but ground supplies compression only when contact exists. Tension-capable springs invent support across gaps. Spring coefficients must also match their per-length or per-area definition; otherwise apparently valid units conceal a wrongly assigned restraint.§reactionPerLength=k*deflection=10000 kN/m2*0.005 m=50 kN/m§用管件撓度形狀與接觸證據比較壓縮限定彈簧模型~Compare deflection profiles and contact evidence with compression-only spring models§假想拉力彈簧支住空腔，低估鋼管彎矩與位移~Artificial tensile springs support voids and underpredict pipe moments and movement§土體彈簧可以在管件離開地層時繼續拉住它~Ground springs continue pulling a pipe after it separates from the soil
撓度量測與儀器基準~Deflection measurements and references§量測到的管棚位移包含整體沉陷、局部彎曲和儀器支點移動，不應直接當作梁的純撓度。多點曲線比單一端點更能辨認跨距與反力改變，控制點須位於可證明穩定的位置，並保留開挖前原始讀值。~Measured movement includes global settlement, local bending and instrument-support motion rather than pure beam deflection. Multipoint profiles better distinguish span and reaction changes than one endpoint. Use demonstrably stable references and preserve readings taken before excavation begins.§relativeDeflection=midpointMovement-supportMean=12 mm-4 mm=8 mm§以獨立控制點修正支承沉陷，再比較管件多點曲線~Correct support settlement using independent control and compare multipoint pipe profiles§隨支護一起移動的基準讓曲線看似穩定而漏掉沉陷~A datum moving with support produces a calm curve while concealing settlement§感測器讀值沒變就能證明管棚位置完全沒變~Unchanged sensor readings prove that the umbrella position has not moved
接頭轉角與局部弱段~Joint rotation and local weak segments§管件接頭的彎曲剛度可能小於連續鋼管，轉角會集中在螺紋或套管附近。用完整截面慣性矩跨過接頭可能低估位移，注漿後也不必然恢復母材連續性；應把接頭位置和最大彎矩區域一起檢查，避免薄弱段重疊。單一測段的位移差除測距僅為弦傾角，接頭相對轉角須比較兩側斜率並扣除共同剛體轉動。~Connections can be more flexible than continuous pipe, concentrating rotation near threads or sleeves. Extending parent-section inertia through a joint can underpredict movement, and grouting need not restore full continuity. Compare connection positions with high-moment regions to identify coincident weaknesses. Displacement difference over one gauge gives chord rotation only; joint rotation requires the difference of slopes on both sides with common rigid-body rotation removed.§apparentChordRotation=offsetDifference/gaugeLength=2 mm/500 mm=0.004 rad; one gauge only, not relative joint rotation§量測接頭兩側相對轉角並記錄接頭所處支承區段~Measure relative rotation across joints and record their supporting ground zones§接頭落在最大彎曲區產生集中轉角並破壞周邊接觸~A joint in the peak-bending zone concentrates rotation and damages surrounding contact§接頭外徑相同就代表剛度與完整母管一致~Equal outside diameter makes a connection as stiff as the parent pipe
支護界面與撤除判斷~Support interfaces and transfer decisions§管棚通常是施工階段系統的一部分，後續初支與閉合環接替荷載時仍有變形歷史。把新襯砌加入模型並不能自動清除管棚受力，未達接觸或硬化條件便假定轉移完成，會低估臨時構件持續承載與周圍鬆動。~An umbrella belongs to a staged system whose load is progressively shared with initial support and a closed ring. Adding lining to a model does not erase existing pipe force. Assuming transfer before contact or hardening understates continued temporary-member demand and surrounding loosening.§transferRatio=measuredNewSupportLoad/assumedTotal=180 kN/300 kN=0.60§把初支齡期、接觸完成、管棚應變與閉合位置共同審查~Review support age, completed contact, umbrella strain and ring-closure position together§新支護尚未參與就假定卸載，造成施工階段荷載缺口~Assumed unloading before new support engages creates an unrecognized staged-load gap§新襯砌完成外觀就代表管棚全部荷載已轉移~A completed lining appearance proves every umbrella load has transferred
''')
